# PocketBase Executable Placeholder

Download PocketBase from: https://github.com/pocketbase/pocketbase/releases

Place the appropriate executable for your OS in this folder:
- Windows: pocketbase.exe
- macOS: pocketbase
- Linux: pocketbase

To start the server:
  ./pocketbase serve

Admin UI: http://localhost:8090/_/
API Base: http://localhost:8090
